    "Adapters.cs": "the doors to agents (Agents), and a start's prompt built from a repository's knowledge and an account's (Accounts)",
    "DriverConfig.cs": "the machine's driver settings, which most modules read (Platform): each module's own rules in it (review, second opinion, workflow, commit, helper, standing answers, accounts) move to that module as it is layered; in Loop, as the design's table first put it, the loop rule would refuse every reader",
